## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

❌ **DON'T** manually maintain `export interface Env` in source code  
❌ **DON'T** use pixel dimensions in URLs (use preset names)  
❌ **DON'T** upscale images (always use `fit: 'scale-down'`)  
❌ **DON'T** forget loop prevention (check both `via` and custom headers)  
❌ **DON'T** fail silently (always return original image on resize failure)  
❌ **DON'T** skip content-type detection (implement fallback)  
❌ **DON'T** use experimental features (stable best practices only)  
❌ **DON'T** forget to test with at least 5 test cases  
❌ **DON'T** use `.toml` config (use `.jsonc` or `.json`)  

## Quick Reference Commands

```bash
# Type generation after binding changes
npm run cf-typegen

# Local development (image resizing won't work)
npm run dev

# Run tests
npm test

# Type check and dry-run deployment
npm run check

# Deploy to Cloudflare
npm run deploy

# Upload test image to R2
wrangler r2 object put my-images/photo.jpg \
  --file ./photo.jpg \
  --content-type "image/jpeg"
```

